Redeem_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when units zero
│  └── it should revert with InvalidAmount
└── when units non zero
   ├── given adapter not authorized on Midnight
   │  └── it should revert in Midnight
   └── given adapter authorized on Midnight
      ├── given units exceed vault credit
      │  └── it should revert in Midnight
      └── given units within vault credit
         ├── it should burn vault credit
         ├── it should send loan token to vault
         └── it should emit AdapterAction
